         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               Astro Bucket List 0.34.1: Fixes saves that could produce collections too large to reopen. Save, Save as and Export now enforce the same size limit as Open before changing files. Rejected saves preserve the existing collection, backup and unsaved edits.
